{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791961680, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T07:08:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T07:09:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791961740, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T07:08:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 64082, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "我是開車者，常碰到行駛單行道時，腳踏車逆向騎來，我的認知，腳踏「車」屬於車輛，該如何改善與懲罰亂象？", "display_name": "大安代表 No.64,082", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T07:08:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 9, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 10797, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "什麼時候路才能燙平，給用路人安全一點的環境！還有騎樓也是～～", "display_name": "松山代表 No.10,797", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T07:08:24+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 38239, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "交通", "content": "捷運環狀線已陸續動工，過去陳水扁上台把黃大洲時代的施工圍籬減少很多，希望沈市長也可以精確減少施工圍籬", "display_name": "文山代表 Robin Lin", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T07:08:39+00:00", "duration_seconds": 21, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 46248, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "datong", "topic": "交通", "content": "重慶北路規劃的捷運，如果可以將公車專用道改成BC級路權的輕軌，將可以大幅提前通車。", "display_name": "大同代表 謝鎮隆", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 10797, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.10,797", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 38239, "sprite_key": "squirrel_suburb", "display_name": "文山代表 Robin Lin", "district": "wenshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 46248, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 謝鎮隆", "district": "datong", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 64083, "sprite_key": "penguin_oldtown", "display_name": "大同代表 No.64,083